  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Informant- and crime-management training course for rhino program field managers and investigators in Kenya, Uganda and Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the ability of law enforcement authorities to investigate and prosecute wildlife crime in Kenya, Uganda and Zambia, this grant supports ten-day training courses conducted by experienced wildlife crime investigators for participants from rhino areas and trafficking transit points.</narrative>
  </description>
